instructions:
The scaffolded package is generic — all per-project identity (worker name, R2 bucket, default From address) lives in the instance files, not in wrangler.jsonc.

Create three instance files in packages/infra/environments/<env>/:

   // inbox-raw.ts — the R2 bucket for raw MIME
   import { r2Module } from '../../modules/r2'
   export default r2Module.instance({
     name: 'inbox-raw',
     config: { accountId: '<account id>', bucketName: '<project>-inbox-raw' },
   })

   // inbox.ts — the worker
   import { cloudflareModule } from '../../modules/cloudflare'
   import inboxRaw from './inbox-raw'
   export default cloudflareModule.instance({
     name: 'inbox',
     imports: [inboxRaw],
     config: {
       workdir: 'packages/inbox',
       accountId: '<account id>',
       workerName: '<project>-inbox',
       workerSecrets: ['INBOX_TOKEN'],
       workerVars: [{ name: 'DEFAULT_FROM', value: 'inbox@mail.<your-domain>' }],
       r2Bindings: [{ binding: 'RAW', from: 'inbox-raw', output: 'bucketName' }],
     },
   })

   // email.ts — sending + routing for the domain
   import { cloudflareEmailModule } from '../../modules/cloudflare-email'
   import inbox from './inbox'
   export default cloudflareEmailModule.instance({
     name: 'email',
     imports: [inbox],
     config: {
       accountId: '<account id>', zoneId: '<zone id>', domain: 'mail.<your-domain>',
       enableSending: true, enableRouting: true,
       catchAll: { action: 'worker', workerName: { from: 'inbox', output: 'workerName' } },
     },
   })

Add INBOX_TOKEN (any long random string, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`) to secrets.yaml. CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN needs the scopes the cloudflare-email module documents PLUS Account → Workers R2 Storage: Edit (for the r2 module).

`zbc apply <env>` provisions the bucket, deploys the worker, and onboards the domain.
Note: Cloudflare holds newly onboarded sending domains in a preview sandbox (verified recipients only) for a short period after DNS validates; arbitrary-recipient sending starts working once it drops.
